                        FORM OF THE CRANE
|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

|YKB'Grace is natural, form can be taught.' |WK0- |RKBMaster Phat Chick
|YK0
Few have the style and grace of a Crane. Calm, yet powerful, at 
peace, yet combating pain. A Monk who masters the Crane
style is one with themselves and capable of achieving amazing
things.

This form unlocks several powers which can ONLY be used
while in the form of the Crane.

These powers are: |GKBShatter|YK0, |GKBCast|YK0, |GKBCrane Dance|YK0 and |GKBCrane Kick|YK0.
